><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Quinine ingestion failed to improve or impair the final 1,000 m and&#xD;overall 3,000-m TT fixed-gear cycling performance when the&#xD;solution was ingested just before the last 1,000 m. The small&#xD;perceptual differences between trials were not easily explained by&#xD;quinine intake.</span
></p
